{# THE MIDDLE RUNG: the shell, without the page frame.

   What a full-bleed screen needs — a map that reaches the edges, a split view.
   If this rung did not exist, such a page would extend the frame anyway and
   then fight `.page` with negative margins, which is how a layout contract
   starts being worked around instead of used.

   `content` is the shell's main slot, and it is the socket every host page and
   every module bundle already fills today — kept by name so the extraction does
   not break five repositories in one commit. #}
{% extends '@Shell/shell.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}<div id="bare-slot">edge to edge</div>{% endblock %}
